dc739fce5","text":"You're welcome! We hope to see you again.","source":"BTS 20 · #91","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/5231f732-fc50-4193-9b4a-fbd682a60d7c.webp","imageBytes":19158},"c1c3e437705d":{"id":"c1c3e437705d","text":"He scored three goals in the match.","source":"BTS 8 · #96","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/d8bc8563-5862-4582-a128-e793dc53a326.webp","imageBytes":46336},"cca28144fc9e":{"id":"cca28144fc9e","text":"I attend weekly team meetings every Monday at ten o'clock.","source":"SIU Basic 3 · #64","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/e3968f80-e406-4b47-87f2-534c5f779a22.webp","imageBytes":11934},"45282a0c5d81":{"id":"45282a0c5d81","text":"A librarian works in a library.","source":"BTS 12 · #70","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/58a69a48-67e1-426b-886d-58a85c9e50a6.webp","imageBytes":20478},"9d977ae0a358":{"id":"9d977ae0a358","text":"Credit cards allow you to borrow money.","source":"BTS 29 · #53","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/ed55e944-db6a-4d25-9b41-e7dc216aeae1.webp","imageBytes":11988},"beaef158752c":{"id":"beaef158752c","text":"When were these books written?","source":"BTS 15 · #64","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/55cd3ffe-54cb-4f95-82a4-f55e2de56c21.webp","imageBytes":12678},"eb3a8c4a1ddc":{"id":"eb3a8c4a1ddc","text":"I would look for magical creatures.","source":"BTS 24 · #28","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/09cf7f29-2166-434c-8335-60744f4a40f9.webp","imageBytes":39378},"80f50b6a7ade":{"id":"80f50b6a7ade","text":"She prefers mystery stories.","source":"BTS 15 · #15","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/1abf0b3b-a57b-4126-81b7-07702d7369a7.webp","imageBytes":8762},"a285252ee4e8":{"id":