2","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/0d091ca8-5df8-444f-9fdd-d094475d8ab8.webp","imageBytes":21328},"f3961554c5c3":{"id":"f3961554c5c3","text":"I help with cooking.","source":"BTS 3 · #88","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/ff071a8f-85d6-498f-bf35-2a819d4cbbbc.webp","imageBytes":16008,"video":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/fba804b0-bba4-470a-8857-8575afa82bc5.mp4","videoBytes":251522,"duration":5.875},"da6455d5ac90":{"id":"da6455d5ac90","text":"Before refrigerators, people had to cook fresh food every day.","source":"BTS 25 · #40","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/8e790dcb-5eeb-4ef7-9215-b7cbeb5cf7ec.webp","imageBytes":19938},"ec0a9482cbc5":{"id":"ec0a9482cbc5","text":"Dusk is when the sun starts to set.","source":"BTS 9 · #88","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/ac594614-d9b2-4497-b67d-b8fb3eafd3b8.webp","imageBytes":2288},"cf1b86039907":{"id":"cf1b86039907","text":"The table is in front of the sofa.","source":"BTS 6 · #65","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/4d6b2f3a-5346-4c63-831e-36e501a6766c.webp","imageBytes":7426},"ef4aa6ac57c8":{"id":"ef4aa6ac57c8","text":"We watch fireworks at midnight.","source":"BTS 21 · #18","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/317f89fd-cd7e-44d8-9859-183d323f600a.webp","imageBytes":16012,"video":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/b011d0c0-b20e-4023-84d0-7a150821fd07.mp4","videoBytes":501386,"duration":5.875},"3903ce32f285":{"id":"3903ce32f285","text":"Television brings news and entertainment into our homes.","source":"BTS 25 · #30","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/122570a5-ad72-4460-9c3f-72603c6d22a1.webp","imageBytes":10004},"c7b1db1499b6":{"id":"c7b