qivYqvn7k/cc691a9e-0980-490e-9c19-2d4fd82bb145.webp","imageBytes":15136},"f6a2f0279322":{"id":"f6a2f0279322","text":"I will see dinosaur fossils and ancient artifacts.","source":"BTS 14 · #94","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/54960757-845a-4068-83d8-464855a92bcf.webp","imageBytes":34912},"9dbaf6dfb889":{"id":"9dbaf6dfb889","text":"Yes, I expect to learn many new things.","source":"BTS 14 · #96","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/5a169efe-42a3-4d2b-995e-3ed7258bef3b.webp","imageBytes":7560},"2af0c07e3255":{"id":"2af0c07e3255","text":"Have you ever dared your friend to do something risky?","source":"BTS 34 · #33","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/a6140d56-034e-4b29-862d-02a2fe893a16.webp","imageBytes":56542},"3365e673e580":{"id":"3365e673e580","text":"Maybe, but it will be worth it.","source":"BTS 14 · #98","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/800d92a0-3ed3-4b72-b11e-634411533ab1.webp","imageBytes":10122},"c9b558897b4b":{"id":"c9b558897b4b","text":"Your clothes tell people about your personality.","source":"BTS 27 · #89","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/26201cde-78ce-464e-bae0-54e4542bec3b.webp","imageBytes":21836},"3d8f416be117":{"id":"3d8f416be117","text":"We learned basic coding through a free online course.","source":"SIU Basic 2 · #50","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/1779d3d1-f8da-49db-a7b4-4f7ac6b791a2.webp","imageBytes":11916}}}
